    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d201">

                <pb facs="0318" n="216" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg216"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 6775/507.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Costa Rican Minister for Foreign
                        Affairs.</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d201-f1"/></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-05-28"><hi rendition="#italic">May 28,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Reference of your Government, in telegram to Costa Rican judge of Central
                    American court, to assistance of Government of United States in efforts of the
                    Washington conference culminating in inauguration of court is much appreciated
                    by this Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Elihu Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d201-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d201-f1-content">
                <p>Mutatis mutandis to the Ministers for Foreign Affairs of Honduras, Guatemala,
                    Salvador, and Nicaragua.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
